/P 506 0 R
/E (Mechanical Engineering, being one of the core branches of engineering, plays a vital role in shaping innovations that drive technological advancement. I am proud of the department's consistent efforts in fostering academic excellence, promoting research culture, and encouraging students to participate in technical and industrial activities. The department has always been at the forefront in organizing workshops, industrial visits, expert talks, and student-driven projects, which contribute significantly to the overall development of our budding engineers.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [6 7]
>>
